-test/scenarios/invoice/invoice.docx", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/invoice/task.md", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/mnda/assets/.gitkeep", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/mnda/criteria.md", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/mnda/mnda.docx", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/mnda/task.md", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/resume/assets/.gitkeep", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/resume/criteria.md", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/resume/resume.docx", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/resume/task.md", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scripts/collect-exercises.ts", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scripts/exercise-metrics.ts", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scripts/local-exercise-prompt.md", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scripts/parse-local-ledger.ts", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scripts/run-local-corpus.ts", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scripts/stage-competitor.ts", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scripts/stage-scenario.ts", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scripts/tsconfig.json"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/contract-finalize/contract-redlined.docx", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/contract-markup/contract.docx", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/invoice/invoice.docx", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/mnda/mnda.docx", ".claude/skills/weak-agent-test/scenarios/resume/resume.docx"], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: weak-agent-test\ndescription: \"Run the weak-agent adversarial test harness against docx-cli. Spawns weak exercise agents (Haiku by default, Sonnet to probe, or a local agent harness's pre-produced runs) to perform real document tasks over six scenarios — five editing (MNDA form-fill + font fidelity, invoice table-edit/restructure + logo replace, résumé styling, contract redlining + commenting, contract finalize via accept/reject + comment reply/resolve) and one authoring (T. S. Eliot poetry journal: multi-column, verse, footnotes, links, figure) — renders every result with Word, has opus judge them against ground-truth rubrics, measures each exercise's tool economy, token cost, wall-clock, and correctness (from transcripts for Claude, the exercise.json ledger for the local harness), and synthesizes a prioritized ergonomics report. Use when the user says 'adversarial review', 'test docx-cli with weak agents', 'run the haiku harness', 'weak agent test', or wants to re-run yesterday's adversarial process.\"\nallowed-tools: Bash, Read, Write, Glob, Workflow\nmetadata:\n  internal: true", "declared_name": "weak-agent-test", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "0b332e918530f2faf7f2", "repository": "kklimuk/docx-cli", "commit_sha": "e830c0cd5aac888cf4b749d278db6e71003ab5d9", "skill_path": "skills/docx-cli/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/kklimuk/docx-cli/blob/e830c0cd5aac888cf4b749d278db6e71003ab5d9/skills/docx-cli/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "0c21450f7d916e61db988e9996c201aafed56352", "sha256": "d09a1093896dcbc95a11a50ce627b32936dacf3c9348696853c8fe8344df65a1", "bytes": 9693, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T10:54:39.411573+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/kklimuk/docx-cli/e830c0cd5aac888cf4b749d278db6e71003ab5d9/skills/docx-cli/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE", "NOTICES"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/kklimuk/docx-cli/e830c0cd5aac888cf4b749d278db6e71003ab5d9.json", "local_package_files": ["skills/docx-cli/SKILL.md", "skills/docx-cli/references/commands.md", "skills/docx-cli/references/troubleshooting.md", "skills/docx-cli/scripts/bootstrap.sh", "skills/docx-cli/scripts/install.sh"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: docx-cli\ndescription: \"Edits, redlines, and comments on Word .docx files in place, keeping their formatting — prefer it over unzipping and hand-editing the XML. Use for tracked changes (redline, accept/reject), comments (add/reply/resolve), filling contracts/NDAs/forms, restyling headings/fonts, margins/page setup, tables, headers/footers/page numbers, footnotes, or reading a .docx as Markdown. Also builds new Word docs and reports from Markdown or code. Not for PDF, Excel, PowerPoint, Google Docs, or .doc.\"", "declared_name": "docx-cli", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
